{
  "an4.233:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 4.233 ",
  "an4.233:0.2": "24. Kammavagga ",
  "an4.233:0.3": "Vitthārasutta ",
  "an4.233:1.1": "“Cattārimāni, bhikkhave, kammāni mayā sayaṁ abhiññā sacchikatvā paveditāni. ",
  "an4.233:1.2": "Katamāni cattāri? ",
  "an4.233:1.3": "Atthi, bhikkhave, kammaṁ kaṇhaṁ kaṇhavipākaṁ; ",
  "an4.233:1.4": "atthi, bhikkhave, kammaṁ sukkaṁ sukkavipākaṁ; ",
  "an4.233:1.5": "atthi, bhikkhave, kammaṁ kaṇhasukkaṁ kaṇhasukkavipākaṁ; ",
  "an4.233:1.6": "atthi, bhikkhave, kammaṁ akaṇhaasukkaṁ akaṇhaasukkavipākaṁ kammakkhayāya saṁvattati. ",
  "an4.233:2.1": "Katamañca, bhikkhave, kammaṁ kaṇhaṁ kaṇhavipākaṁ? ",
  "an4.233:2.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, ekacco sabyābajjhaṁ kāyasaṅkhāraṁ abhisaṅkharoti, sabyābajjhaṁ vacīsaṅkhāraṁ abhisaṅkharoti, sabyābajjhaṁ manosaṅkhāraṁ abhisaṅkharoti. ",
  "an4.233:2.3": "So sabyābajjhaṁ kāyasaṅkhāraṁ abhisaṅkharitvā, sabyābajjhaṁ vacīsaṅkhāraṁ abhisaṅkharitvā, sabyābajjhaṁ manosaṅkhāraṁ abhisaṅkharitvā sabyābajjhaṁ lokaṁ upapajjati. ",
  "an4.233:2.4": "Tamenaṁ sabyābajjhaṁ lokaṁ upapannaṁ samānaṁ sabyābajjhā phassā phusanti. ",
  "an4.233:2.5": "So sabyābajjhehi phassehi phuṭṭho samāno sabyābajjhaṁ vedanaṁ vediyati ekantadukkhaṁ, seyyathāpi sattā nerayikā. ",
  "an4.233:2.6": "Idaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, kammaṁ kaṇhaṁ kaṇhavipākaṁ. ",
  "an4.233:3.1": "Katamañca, bhikkhave, k